{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01GP4J1GLN1sESNnqHaQt9uJ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://revistas.usc.gal/index.php/dereito/article/view/1190/1546\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.deia.eus/opinion/columnistas/2017/11/03/judicial-4910642.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://pulitzercenter.org/node/33431\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.deia.eus/opinion/columnistas/2017/11/03/judicial-4910642.amp.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.jornada.com.mx/2020/01/30/opinion/030o1cap\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.elindependiente.com/politica/2018/03/23/interio-no-monto-dispositivo-evitar-riesgo-fuga-advierte-juez/amp/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://theobjective.com/espana/2024-07-23/plan-perfecto-fugarse-prision-cita-medica-dentista/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.vozpopuli.com/espana/presos-proces-protocolo-volver-cataluna_0_1255375496.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.menorca.info/actualidad/nacional/2026/04/20/2613063/acusacion-particular-reclama-anos-carcel-para-begona-gomez-retirada-pasaporte-por-riesgo-fuga.html\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:35:56.028Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "jueces pasaron a ser laicos acusados recluidos en cárceles civiles para evitar su fuga España", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01NF6fARVw2USvgnXj781tS4", "content": [{"title": "revistas.usc.gal", "url": "https://revistas.usc.gal/index.php/dereito/article/view/1190/1546"}, {"title": "judicial 4910642", "url": "https://www.deia.eus/opinion/columnistas/2017/11/03/judicial-4910642.html"}, {"title": "Translate page with Google", "url": "https://pulitzercenter.org/node/33431"}, {"title": "Síguenos en redes sociales:", "url": "https://www.deia.eus/opinion/columnistas/2017/11/03/judicial-4910642.amp.html"}, {"title": "Fuga: tras corruptos y corruptores", "url": "https://www.jornada.com.mx/2020/01/30/opinion/030o1cap"}, {"title": "www.elindependiente.com", "url": "https://www.elindependiente.com/politica/2018/03/23/interio-no-monto-dispositivo-evitar-riesgo-fuga-advierte-juez/amp/"}, {"title": "The Objective", "url": "https://theobjective.com/espana/2024-07-23/plan-perfecto-fugarse-prision-cita-medica-dentista/"}, {"title": "presos proces protocolo volver cataluna 0 1255375496", "url": "https://www.vozpopuli.com/espana/presos-proces-protocolo-volver-cataluna_0_1255375496.html"}, {"title": "acusacion particular reclama anos carcel para begona gomez retirada pasaporte por riesgo fuga", "url": "https://www.menorca.info/actualidad/nacional/2026/04/20/2613063/acusacion-particular-reclama-anos-carcel-para-begona-gomez-retirada-pasaporte-por-riesgo-fuga.html"}]}, "No results directly match the query. Nothing I found reports judges being classed as \"laicos\" or detained in civil prisons to prevent their escape in Spain, so I can't confirm that premise.\n\nThe closest material is about prison escapes and flight risk in Spain:\n\n- **Escapes during transfers:** A 2024 report says most escapes in Spain happen when prisoners are taken from prison to hospitals, dentists, or courts, and the Guardia Civil escorts them. Figures supplied by Instituciones Penitenciarias and collected by the AUGC show most escapes in recent years happened during those transfers. The same article says very few of these attempts succeed.\n- **Flight risk as a legal ground:** Spanish courts have used flight risk to justify detention. In the Catalan independence case, the judge cited Puigdemont's flight as grounds for jailing the consellers over the alleged risk of escape.\n- **Historical context:** A legal-history article notes that in the relatively likely case that a prisoner escaped, the guards watching over them would be punished.\n\nIf you meant a specific case involving judges, a different term (such as \"jueces legos\" or \"jueces de paz\") or a country outside Spain may return better results."], "durationSeconds": 5.901320375, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01GP4J1GLN1sESNnqHaQt9uJ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
